# Azure Best Practices Guidelines

## Mục tiêu

Tài liệu này định nghĩa các nguyên tắc và best practices cho việc sử dụng Microsoft Azure trong Cursor Enterprise Framework. Mục tiêu là đảm bảo secure, scalable, và cost-effective deployments trên Azure platform.

Azure cung cấp comprehensive set của cloud services. Việc tuân thủ best practices giúp teams optimize Azure workloads và maintain security compliance.

## Nguyên tắc cơ bản

### 1. Azure Architecture Center

Reference architectures.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Azure Architecture Patterns                      │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                  │
│  Web Applications                                               │
│  └── App Service → Azure SQL → Redis Cache → CDN                 │
│                                                                  │
│  Microservices                                                 │
│  └── AKS → Cosmos DB → Event Grid → API Management             │
│                                                                  │
│  Serverless                                                   │
│  └── Functions → Event Grid → Cosmos DB → Logic Apps            │
│                                                                  │
│  Data & Analytics                                             │
│  └── Data Lake → Synapse → Databricks → Power BI                │
│                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 2. Resource Organization

Resource groups và management.

```bash
# Resource naming convention
# Format: <Environment>-<Service>-<Region>-<Instance>

# Resource Group Structure
resource_groups:
  production:
    - rg-prod-weu-app-001  # West Europe - App Services
    - rg-prod-weu-data-001 # West Europe - Data Services
    - rg-prod-weu-net-001  # West Europe - Networking

  staging:
    - rg-staging-weu-app-001
    - rg-staging-weu-data-001

# Tags
tags:
  Environment: production
  Service: api
  Owner: platform-team
  CostCenter: engineering
  ManagedBy: terraform
```

### 3. App Service Best Practices

Web application hosting.

```yaml
# App Service configuration
app_service:
  # Service Plan
  plan:
    name: asp-production
    tier: PremiumV3
    size: P3V3  # 4 cores, 16GB RAM
    capacity: 3

    # Auto-scale
    autoscale:
      enabled: true
      rules:
        - condition: CPUPercentage > 70
          direction: Increase
          step: 2
          min: 3
          max: 10
        - condition: CPUPercentage < 30
          direction: Decrease
          step: 1
          min: 3
          max: 10

  # Web App
  webapp:
    name: api-prod-weu-001
    runtime: nodejs18-lts
    always_on: true
    min_tls_version: "1.2"

    # Settings
    settings:
      WEBSITE_NODE_DEFAULT_VERSION: "~18"
      WEBSITE_RUN_FROM_PACKAGE: "1"
      APPINSIGHTS_PROFILERFEATURE_VERSION: "1.0.0"
      APPINSIGHTS_SNAPSHOTFEATURE_VERSION: "1.0.0"

    # Deployment
    deployment:
      slot_name: staging
      auto_swap: true
      health_check:
        enabled: true
        path: /health

    # Networking
    vnet_integration: true
    private_endpoint: true
```

### 4. Azure Functions Best Practices

Serverless compute.

```yaml
# Azure Functions configuration
functions:
  # App Service Plan
  app_service_plan:
    name: func-consumption-plan
    tier: Premium
    max_burst: 200
    always_ready: 2

  # Function App
  function_app:
    name: api-functions-prod
    runtime: node
    version: 18

    # Settings
    settings:
      AzureWebJobsStorage: DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...
      FUNCTIONS_WORKER_RUNTIME: node
      NODE_ENV: production

    # Performance
    function_scale:
      dynamic: true
      max_instances: 200

    # Networking
    vnet_integration:
      enabled: true
      subnet: functions-subnet

    # Durable Functions
    durable_functions:
      enabled: true
      task_hub:
        type: AzureStorage
        partition_count: 4

    # Triggers
    triggers:
      http:
        auth_level: function
      timer:
        enabled: true
      queue:
        enabled: true
```

### 5. Cosmos DB Best Practices

NoSQL database.

```yaml
# Cosmos DB configuration
cosmos_db:
  # Account
  account:
    name: app-cosmos-prod
    type: GlobalDocumentDB
    kind: MongoDB
    enable_multiple_write_locations: false
    consistency_level: Session
    automatic_failover: true

  # Database
  database:
    name: appdb
    throughput: 1000

  # Collections/Containers
  containers:
    - name: users
      partition_key: /userId
      throughput: 1000
      ttl: -1
      indexes:
        - paths:
            - /email
          unique: true
        - paths:
            - /createdAt

    - name: orders
      partition_key: /userId
      throughput: 2000
      ttl: 2592000  # 30 days
      conflict_resolution:
        mode: LastWriterWins

    - name: products
      partition_key: /category
      throughput: 500

  # Global distribution
  geo_replication:
    enabled: true
    regions:
      - location: westeurope
        is_write_region: true
      - location: northeurope

  # Backup
  backup:
    mode: Periodic
    interval_in_minutes: 240
    retention_in_hours: 8
    storage_redundancy: Geo
```

### 6. Azure SQL Best Practices

Managed database services.

```yaml
# Azure SQL configuration
azure_sql:
  # Server
  server:
    name: sql-app-prod
    admin_login: sqladmin
    version: "12.0"
    minimal_tls_version: "1.2"

  # Database
  database:
    name: appdb
    tier: GeneralPurpose
    family: Gen5
    capacity: 4  # 4 vCores

    # Storage
    storage:
      size: 50GB
      max_size: 100GB
      auto_growth: true

    # Performance
    auto_pause_delay: 60
    read_scale: true
    htp_enabled: true

  # Security
  security:
    enable_va: true
    va_scan_enabled: true
    tde_encryption: true

    firewall_rules:
      - name: AllowAzureServices
        start_ip: 0.0.0.0
        end_ip: 0.0.0.0
      - name: DeveloperAccess
        start_ip: x.x.x.x
        end_ip: x.x.x.x

  # Connection
  connection:
    connection_string: |
      Server=tcp:sql-app-prod.database.windows.net;
      Database=appdb;
      Encrypt=true;
      TrustServerCertificate=false;
```

### 7. AKS Best Practices

Kubernetes on Azure.

```yaml
# AKS configuration
aks:
  # Cluster
  cluster:
    name: aks-prod-cluster
    kubernetes_version: "1.27"
    dns_prefix: aks-prod

    # Network
    network:
      network_plugin: azure
      network_policy: azure
      load_balancer_sku: standard

    # API Server
    api_server:
      authorized_ip_ranges:
        - 10.0.0.0/8
      enable_private_cluster: true

  # Node pools
  node_pools:
    system:
      name: nodepool-system
      vm_size: Standard_D4s_v3
      count: 3
      os_type: Linux
      availability_zones: ["1", "2", "3"]

    user:
      name: nodepool-user
      vm_size: Standard_D8s_v3
      count: 5
      min_count: 2
      max_count: 10
      os_type: Linux

    gpu:
      name: nodepool-gpu
      vm_size: Standard_NC6s_v3
      count: 0  # Scale to 0 when not needed

  # Add-ons
  addons:
    ingress:
      enabled: true
      type: nginx
      backend_pool_id: /subscriptions/.../backendPools/appgw

    monitoring:
      enabled: true
      log_analytics_workspace: /subscriptions/.../workspaces/logws

    azure_policy: true
```

### 8. Azure Networking

Virtual networks và security.

```yaml
# Virtual Network configuration
virtual_network:
  # Address space
  address_space: 10.0.0.0/16

  # Subnets
  subnets:
    - name: GatewaySubnet
      address_prefix: 10.0.0.0/27
      delegations: []

    - name: AzureBastionSubnet
      address_prefix: 10.0.1.0/27

    - name: web
      address_prefix: 10.0.10.0/24
      nsg: nsg-web
      service_endpoints:
        - Microsoft.Storage
        - Microsoft.KeyVault

    - name: app
      address_prefix: 10.0.20.0/24
      nsg: nsg-app
      delegations:
        - name: Microsoft.Web/serverFarms

    - name: data
      address_prefix: 10.0.30.0/24
      nsg: nsg-data
      private_endpoint_network_policies: enabled

  # NSG rules
  nsg:
    web:
      rules:
        - name: AllowHTTPS
          priority: 100
          direction: Inbound
          access: Allow
          protocol: Tcp
          source: Internet
          destination: "*"
          destination_port: 443

        - name: DenyAll
          priority: 4096
          direction: Inbound
          access: Deny

# Private DNS
private_dns:
  - name: private.azure.com
    zone_group: default
    registration_enabled: false
```

### 9. Azure Monitor & Logging

Observability on Azure.

```yaml
# Azure Monitor configuration
azure_monitor:
  # Log Analytics
  log_analytics:
    workspace:
      name: law-prod
      location: westeurope
      retention_days: 90
      daily_cap: 10GB

  # Application Insights
  app_insights:
    name: appinsights-prod
    sampling_percentage: 100
    diagnostics:
      enabled: true
      categories:
        - PerformanceCounter
        - Exceptions
        - Requests
        - Traces

  # Metrics
  metrics:
    alert_rules:
      - name: HighCPU
        condition: cpu_percentage > 80
        frequency: 5m
        window: 15m
        severity: warning

      - name: HighMemory
        condition: memory_percentage > 85
        frequency: 5m
        window: 15m
        severity: warning

  # Workbooks
  workbooks:
    - name: AppDashboard
      type: workbook
      shared: true

# Container insights
container_insights:
  enabled: true
  log_analytics_workspace: law-prod
  retention_days: 30
```

### 10. Cost Management

Azure cost optimization.

```yaml
# Cost management
cost_management:
  # Budget alerts
  budgets:
    - name: production-budget
      amount: 10000
      time_grain: Monthly
      alert_config:
        - threshold: 80
          operators: GreaterThan
        - threshold: 100
          operators: GreaterThan

  # Reservations
  reservations:
    - service: AppService
      term: 1Year
      quantity: 3
      tier: Premium V3 P1mv3

    - service: CosmosDB
      term: 3Year
      tier: Provisioned IOPS

  # Policies
  policies:
    - name: tag-required
      mode: All
      policy_definition:
        if:
          field: tags
          equals: {}
        then:
          effect: deny

    - name: allowed-locations
      mode: All
      parameters:
        listOfAllowedLocations:
          - westeurope
          - northeurope
```

